     *       leading slash (unless the input was {@code null}).</li>
     *   <li>Handles edge‑cases such as an empty string or a string consisting
     *       solely of slashes.</li>
     * </ul>
     *
     * @param path the raw path component, may be {@code null}
     * @return a normalised path that always starts with a single '/', or {@code null}
     */
    private static String normalizePath(final String path) {
        if (path == null) {
            return null;
        }

        // Count leading slashes
        int leadingSlashCount = 0;
        while (leadingSlashCount < path.length()
                && path.charAt(leadingSlashCount) == '/') {
            leadingSlashCount++;
        }

        String normalized;
